WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.514
Some stations are better not shown to
everyone.

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:09.154
In this video you will learn what the three
privacy levels mean, how to ask for a change,

00:00:09.274 --> 00:00:11.602
and how to take your request back.

00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:15.897
Privacy is set on each station's own page.

00:00:16.017 --> 00:00:18.729
So first, find your station.

00:00:18.849 --> 00:00:22.761
On My stations, type part of its name into
Search.

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:25.551
Click the station's row.

00:00:25.671 --> 00:00:27.735
A small pop-up opens.

00:00:27.855 --> 00:00:31.215
Press Open full page to go to the station
page.

00:00:32.017 --> 00:00:35.353
This is the station page for Asha's village
well.

00:00:35.473 --> 00:00:38.353
Everything about this one station is here.

00:00:39.183 --> 00:00:42.087
Under the grey reminder is the Privacy card.

00:00:42.207 --> 00:00:45.231
It tells you who can see this station right
now.

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:47.946
Now it says Public.

00:00:48.066 --> 00:00:53.130
Public means everyone who uses OurWater can
see this station and its measurements.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:55.866
Every new station starts this way.

00:00:56.683 --> 00:00:59.011
Sometimes you want more care.

00:00:59.131 --> 00:01:03.739
Maybe the well is on private land, or you are
still checking your numbers.

00:01:03.859 --> 00:01:06.235
Then you can ask for privacy.

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:09.642
You cannot change privacy yourself.

00:01:09.762 --> 00:01:13.026
You ask, and an administrator decides.

00:01:13.146 --> 00:01:15.618
The note under the button says so.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:18.802
Click Ask to change privacy.

00:01:18.922 --> 00:01:23.554
A box opens with the name of your station, and
a choice of two levels.

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:27.071
Measurements private is the first level.

00:01:27.191 --> 00:01:31.895
Everyone can still find the station on the
map, but its measurements are hidden.

00:01:32.717 --> 00:01:39.533
The numbers stay visible to the people who look after the
station: you, your organisation, your teams,

00:01:39.653 --> 00:01:41.573
and administrators.

00:01:42.383 --> 00:01:45.119
Station private is the second level.

00:01:45.239 --> 00:01:48.983
The whole station is hidden, together with its
measurements.

00:01:49.817 --> 00:01:57.305
The same people can still see it, and record at it: you,
your organisation and teams, and administrators.

00:01:57.425 --> 00:02:00.497
Private never locks you out of your own
station.

00:02:01.317 --> 00:02:03.597
Everyone else sees less.

00:02:03.717 --> 00:02:09.549
With Measurements private, they see a note instead
of the numbers, and they can ask you for the data.

00:02:09.669 --> 00:02:13.917
With Station private, the station does not
appear for them at all.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.622
Now choose.

00:02:16.742 --> 00:02:22.406
Measurements private is already selected, and
we will keep it, the gentler of the two.

00:02:23.217 --> 00:02:25.353
Next, say why.

00:02:25.473 --> 00:02:30.993
The reason is optional, but a short, clear
reason helps the administrator decide.

00:02:31.817 --> 00:02:35.321
Under the box it says that a Super Admin
decides.

00:02:35.441 --> 00:02:38.153
That is an administrator of OurWater.

00:02:38.273 --> 00:02:40.769
You will get a message when they do.

00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:43.455
Press Send request.

00:02:43.575 --> 00:02:45.711
The box says Request sent.

00:02:45.831 --> 00:02:51.375
Nothing changes yet: the station stays as it
is until an administrator approves.

00:02:52.183 --> 00:02:54.055
Press Done.

00:02:54.175 --> 00:03:00.583
Back on the page, the Privacy card now says your request
is waiting, and names the level you asked for.

00:03:01.417 --> 00:03:05.233
While the request waits, the station is still
public.

00:03:05.353 --> 00:03:08.977
Nothing is hidden, and you can keep adding
measurements.

00:03:09.783 --> 00:03:13.215
The Ask button has turned into Cancel the
request.

00:03:13.335 --> 00:03:16.239
Only one request can wait at a time.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:20.506
Click Cancel the request, and it is withdrawn.

00:03:20.626 --> 00:03:24.586
Do this if you change your mind, or if you
asked by mistake.

00:03:25.417 --> 00:03:29.905
The card says Now: Public again, and the Ask
button is back.

00:03:30.025 --> 00:03:32.665
You can ask again whenever you like.

00:03:33.483 --> 00:03:39.051
When an administrator approves a request, the card
shows the new level and you get a message.

00:03:39.171 --> 00:03:43.227
Later, the same button lets you ask to be
Public again.

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:47.146
To remember: Public shows everything.

00:03:47.266 --> 00:03:49.978
Measurements private hides the numbers.

00:03:50.098 --> 00:03:53.050
Station private hides the whole station.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:56.434
You ask, and an administrator decides.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.194
That is the whole page.

00:03:59.314 --> 00:04:03.970
You can replay this tutorial any time from the
Learning page inside the app.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.754
Thanks for helping look after our water.
